OL,3,GNEWSARare waterspout may have damaged
OL,4,Atrees near coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FDamage to trees and a house on the
OL,7,FEssex coast could have been caused by a
OL,8,Frare waterspout, tornado researchers
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FPeople in Frinton-on-Sea reported at
OL,12,Fabout 11:40 BST that strong winds had
OL,13,Fhit, causing damage in the areas of
OL,14,FRainham Way and Stansted Way.
OL,16,FThe Tornado and Storm Research
OL,17,FOrganisation (TORRO) said it was not
OL,18,Fclear yet whether it had been a tornado
OL,19,For just strong winds, but it was
OL,20,Fpossible it had been a waterspout after
OL,21,Fsimilar reports in Kent earlier in the
OL,22,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
